ERROR:  schema conflict: inh.d inherits from inh.q, whose columns the merge doesn't give it
DETAIL:  One side changed the inheritance, and the other the columns of either table; a table inheriting from another must have each of its columns, of the same type.
SELECT dolt_merge('table_grows');
ERROR:  schema conflict: inh.tt is of type inh.ty, whose attributes the merge doesn't give it as its columns
DETAIL:  One side made the table typed, and the other changed its columns or the type's attributes; a typed table's columns are exactly its type's.
